From 4479a12e821a9cc3aa21ae499fbef34cd885c838 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 0cwa <0@none.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:05:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Firebase-free build while preserving push choices

Add a Firebase-free build with AI-assisted compatibility changes. Reuse
Molly open-source services and proxy-aware maps, keep the standard Firebase
build, and retain UnifiedPush and websocket paths.

Inspired by Angus Turnbull's b13bff463547475bbe1ae55335add689f52532e0
("Stub out Google Mobile Services and Firebase with Open Source library,
new build flavor 'gms' to use it") in https://github.com/tw-hx/Signal-Android.
This layer uses Molly's own open-source services instead of that commit's
stub library.

Inspired-by: Angus Turnbull <github@twinhelix.com>

Based-On-Source-Commit: 03999be43376589ca06db09671e660d0ffe30ee6
Source-Commit: 4479a12e821a9cc3aa21ae499fbef34cd885c838

